-- Reg 77(4): a suspension, limitation or other restriction may not last more than 12 months.  Not exceeding is not a grant of anything: paragraph (2) is.
-- src:2493 | (4) The period for which a suspension, limitation or other restriction is to have effect may not exceed 12 months.
@ref reg 77(4) (src:2493)
GIVEN `the period for which it is to have effect, in months` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 77(4) the period of the suspension, limitation or other restriction is permitted` IS
