      `the FCA gave P a decision notice` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it did so without undue delay` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 81(6) the FCA gave P a decision notice without undue delay` IS
    IF `the FCA decides to impose a sanction on P under regulation 76, 77 or 78`
    THEN IF `the FCA gave P a decision notice` AND `it did so without undue delay`
