    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If the FCA decides to impose a sanction on P under regulation 76, 77 or 78"; the duty does not arise, so there is no answer here: ask `reg 81(6) the duty to give P a decision notice arises`

