§§ `Regulation 82 -- The FCA: procedure (general)`

-- Reg 82(1): sections 389, 390 and 392 to 395 of FSMA apply to the warning notice under 81(2) and the decision notice under 81(6), subject to paragraphs (2) and (3).  What those sections say is outside the sources.
-- src:2563 | (1) Sections 389 (notices of discontinuance), 390 (final notices) and 392 (application of sections 393 and 394) to 395 (the FCA's and PRA's procedures) of FSMA apply in relation to a warning notice given under regulation 81(2) and a decision notice given under regulation 81(6) as they apply in relation to a warning notice or decision notice given under FSMA, subject to paragraphs (2) to (3).
@ref reg 82(1) (src:2563)
DECLARE `reg 82(1) section of FSMA` IS ONE OF
    `reg 82(1) section 389 (notices of discontinuance)`
    `reg 82(1) section 390 (final notices)`
    `reg 82(1) sections 392 to 395 (application of sections 393 and 394, the FCA's and PRA's procedures)`
    `reg 82(1) some other section of FSMA`

@ref reg 82(1) (src:2563)
GIVEN `the notice is a warning notice given under regulation 81(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notice is a decision notice given under regulation 81(6)` IS A BOOLEAN
      section IS A `reg 82(1) section of FSMA`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 82(1) the section of FSMA applies to the notice` IS
    IF `the notice is a warning notice given under regulation 81(2)` OR `the notice is a decision notice given under regulation 81(6)`
    THEN CONSIDER section
         WHEN `reg 82(1) section 389 (notices of discontinuance)` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `reg 82(1) section 390 (final notices)` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `reg 82(1) sections 392 to 395 (application of sections 393 and 394, the FCA's and PRA's procedures)` THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN `reg 82(1) some other section of FSMA` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the paragraph names these sections and says nothing of any other
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a warning notice given under regulation 81(2) and a decision notice given under regulation 81(6)"

-- Reg 82(2)(a): the substituted subsection (4) of section 390: a final notice about a cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction under regulation 77 or 78.
-- src:2564 | (2) Section 390 of FSMA has effect as if—
-- src:2565 | (a) for subsection (4) there were substituted—
-- src:2566 | (4) A final notice about a cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction under regulation 77 or 78 of the Money Laundering, Terrorist Financing and Transfer of Funds (Information on the Payer) Regulations 2017 (“the 2017 Regulations”) must—
-- src:2567 | (a) specify the permission, authorisation or registration which is being cancelled, suspended or the terms of the limitation or other restriction being imposed, and
-- src:2568 | (b) give details of—
-- src:2569 | (i) the date on which the cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction has effect, and
-- src:2570 | (ii) the period for which the suspension, limitation or other restriction is imposed.
-- src:2571 | (4A) A final notice about a prohibition under regulation 78 of the 2017 Regulations must—
-- src:2572 | (a) specify the extent of the prohibition; and
-- src:2573 | (b) give details of the date on which the prohibition has effect, and if relevant the period for which it has effect.
-- src:2574 | (b) subsections (6), (7) and (10) were omitted.
@ref reg 82(2) (src:2564-2574)
GIVEN `the final notice is about a cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction under regulation 77 or 78` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it specifies the permission, authorisation or registration being cancelled or suspended, or the terms of the limitation or other restriction` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it gives details of the date on which the cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction has effect` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the measure is a suspension, limitation or other restriction (which has a period)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it gives details of the period for which the suspension, limitation or other restriction is imposed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 82(2)(a) the final notice about a cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction contains what it must` IS
    IF `the final notice is about a cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction under regulation 77 or 78`
    THEN IF `it specifies the permission, authorisation or registration being cancelled or suspended, or the terms of the limitation or other restriction` AND `it gives details of the date on which the cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction has effect` AND ((NOT `the measure is a suspension, limitation or other restriction (which has a period)`) OR `it gives details of the period for which the suspension, limitation or other restriction is imposed`)
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A final notice about a cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction under regulation 77 or 78 ... must— (a) specify ..., and (b) give details of—" [marginal (c)]
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(4) A final notice about a cancellation, suspension, limitation or other restriction"

GIVEN `the final notice is about a prohibition under regulation 78` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it specifies the extent of the prohibition` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it gives details of the date on which the prohibition has effect` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the prohibition has a period` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it gives details of the period for which the prohibition has effect` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 82(2)(a) the final notice about a prohibition contains what it must` IS
    IF `the final notice is about a prohibition under regulation 78`
    THEN IF `it specifies the extent of the prohibition` AND `it gives details of the date on which the prohibition has effect` AND ((NOT `the prohibition has a period`) OR `it gives details of the period for which the prohibition has effect`)
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A final notice about a prohibition under regulation 78 of the 2017 Regulations must— (a) specify the extent of the prohibition; and (b) give details of the date" [marginal (c)]
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(4A) A final notice about a prohibition under regulation 78"

@ref reg 82(2)(b) (src:2574)
GIVEN `the subsection number of section 390 of FSMA` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 82(2)(b) the subsection of section 390 of FSMA is omitted` IS
    IF elem `the subsection number of section 390 of FSMA` (LIST 6, 7, 10)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(b) omits subsections (6), (7) and (10) and says nothing of any other

