@ref reg 83(1A) (src:2588)
GIVEN `the Commissioners impose a sanction on P under regulation 76, 77 or 78` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Commissioners checked beforehand whether P has any criminal convictions that may be relevant to the determination referred to in paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reg 83(1A) the Commissioners checked whether P has criminal convictions` IS
    IF `the Commissioners impose a sanction on P under regulation 76, 77 or 78`
    THEN IF `the Commissioners checked beforehand whether P has any criminal convictions that may be relevant to the determination referred to in paragraph (1)`
