    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Before imposing a sanction on P under regulation 76, 77 or 78"; the duty does not arise, so there is no answer here: ask `reg 83(1A) the duty to check whether P has criminal convictions arises`

