         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the FCA must— (a) defer the publication ...; or (b) publish the information on an anonymous basis if publication on that basis would ensure the effective protection of any anonymised personal data" [marginal (c)]
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where paragraph (5) applies"; the duty does not arise, so there is no answer here: ask `reg 84(6) the duty to defer the publication or publish it anonymously arises`

