    THEN IF `the Commissioners deferred the publication until such time as paragraph (4) ceases to apply` OR (`the Commissioners published the information on an anonymous basis` AND `publication on that basis would ensure the effective protection of any anonymised personal data in the information`)
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the Commissioners must— (a) defer the publication ...; or (b) publish the information on an anonymous basis if publication on that basis would ensure the effective protection of any anonymised personal data" [marginal (c)]
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where paragraph (4) applies"; the duty does not arise, so there is no answer here: ask `reg 85(5) the duty to defer the publication or publish it anonymously arises`

