DECIDE `reg 87(5) the person benefits from the conduct` IS
    IF `the person obtains property as a result of or in connection with the conduct`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A person benefits from conduct if that person obtains property as a result of or in connection with the conduct" [marginal (a)]

-- Reg 87(6): a disclosure by a professional legal adviser that falls within the paragraph.  Subject to paragraph (7).
