    IF `the proceedings are for an offence under these Regulations` AND `the court is the appropriate court in the United Kingdom having jurisdiction in the place where that person is for the time being`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Proceedings against any person for an offence under these Regulations"

