DECIDE `reg 91(3) the rules of court relating to the service of documents have effect as if the body were a body corporate` IS
    IF `the body is a partnership or an unincorporated association`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a partnership or unincorporated association"

-- Reg 91(4): the statutory procedures for charging a corporation apply (by limb, to the two nations named).
